sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Root as Program.cs
    participant Db as AddPostgres<br/>brought by vp-postgres
    participant Registry as HealthCheckServiceOptions<br/>the framework's, in the application's container
    participant Mgmt as ManagementServer<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Management/ManagementServer.cs
    participant Probe as Orchestrator probe

    Root->>+Db: services.AddPostgres(postgres)
    Db->>Registry: AddHealthChecks().AddNpgSql(dsn, name: "database")
    Db-->>-Root: registered
    Root->>+Mgmt: services.AddManagement(), no argument
    Mgmt-->>-Root: one more Entry
    Note over Root: EntryRunner starts every entry
    Root->>+Mgmt: run the management entry
    Mgmt->>+Registry: every registration
    Registry-->>-Mgmt: "database", whatever else is there
    Probe->>Mgmt: GET /health/ready
    Note over Mgmt,Probe: without vp-health nothing reads the registry, and the check never runs
    Mgmt-->>-Probe: 200, or 503 naming the failed checks
